{#-
  links.njk
  =========
  Macros shared by the LLM Wiki templates. Import with:
    {% import "links.njk" as wiki %}

  Links are path-qualified ([[<datamodel>/entities/<entity>|label]]) because
  entity ids repeat across data models (Warehouse exists in WMS, OptimalERP
  and the DWH). Generate every data model into the same wiki root so the
  paths resolve.
-#}

{#- Link to an entity page. `dmId` is the owning data model id; for a
    cross-referenced entity that is `ent.$parent.id`. Set `inTable` inside a
    markdown table, where the alias pipe must be escaped. -#}
{%- macro entity(ent, dmId, label, inTable) -%}
[[{{ dmId }}/entities/{{ ent.id }}{{ "\\|" if inTable else "|" }}{{ label or ent.name }}]]
{%- endmacro -%}
